  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a medium pan over medium heat.",
    "Add the diced onion and saut\u00119 until it is translucent and slightly caramelized.",
    "Add the buckwheat flour and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Slowly pour in the vegetable broth, whisking continuously to avoid lumps.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 15-20 minutes or until the buckwheat is al dente.",
    "Season with smoked salt and chopped parsley to taste.",
    "Serve hot."
